extDescription:
When this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can activate 1 of these effects; 
<br>• You destroy Spell/Trap Cards on the field, up to the number of other "HERO" monsters you control. 
<br>• Add 1 "HERO" monster from your Deck to your hand.

